# Copy this file to .env and fill in what you have. BOTH KEYS ARE OPTIONAL.
# Without any keys the whole Job Search OS still works: paste a job description
# into Claude and run /quick-start, /job-fit-scorer, /resume-tailor as normal.
#
# With APIFY_TOKEN only: find-jobs, find-people, enrich, watch, export and query
#   all work. You get a real job feed and a referral graph. Fit scores stay blank
#   (shown as "—"), because guessing a score would be fabricating one.
# With both keys: fit scores, duplicate collapsing, role archetypes and referral
#   warmth ranking turn on.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Apify — runs the LinkedIn readers on residential proxies.
# We never log in as you. No LinkedIn cookie of yours is ever used, no
# connection request is ever sent automatically. Public data only.
# Get a token (free tier included): https://console.apify.com/account/integrations
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
APIFY_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Voyage AI — text embeddings. This is what ranks 500 scraped jobs down to the
# 25 worth reading, before a single expensive LLM call.
# Get a key: https://dashboard.voyageai.com/api-keys
# The free tier grants tokens but caps you at 3 requests/min. The scripts back
# off and retry on their own. Adding a card lifts the cap.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VOYAGE_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional overrides. You almost certainly do not need to touch these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VOYAGE_TEXT_MODEL=voyage-3.5
# VOYAGE_TEXT_BATCH=16
# DB_PATH=./data/jobs.db

# Actor overrides. The normalizers in src/apify.ts target the harvestapi
# payload shapes. Change an actor and expect a "keys seen" error until you remap.
# APIFY_ACTOR_JOBS=harvestapi/linkedin-job-search
# APIFY_ACTOR_EMPLOYEES=harvestapi/linkedin-company-employees
# APIFY_ACTOR_PROFILE=harvestapi/linkedin-profile-scraper
# APIFY_ACTOR_POSTS=harvestapi/linkedin-profile-posts
# APIFY_ACTOR_COMPANY_POSTS=harvestapi/linkedin-company-posts
# APIFY_ACTOR_POST_SEARCH=harvestapi/linkedin-post-search
